<h3>Mobile App</h3>
<h4>Navigation Bar</h4>
<p>
    Tap on <strong>User</strong> to open the user section.
</p>
<p>
    Tap on <strong>Search</strong> to open the instances search engine.
</p>
<p>
    Tap on <strong>Help</strong> to open this help section.
</p>

<h4>Header</h4>
<p>
    Tap on the button <strong>i</strong> to see:
    <ul>
        <li>server date and time,</li>
        <li>server,</li>
        <li>software version.</li>
    </ul>
</p>

<h4>User section</h4>
<p>
    The field <strong>user code</strong> is the currently logged user.
</p>
<p>
    Tap on <strong>logout</strong> to log out and go back to login page.
</p>